# Editable world plan. Bays are 7x7 map units; grid coordinates start at 0.
# Repeated room IDs join bays into one room. Door offsets are 0-based from the bay edge.
# Doorway format: door <room-ID> <room-ID> <offset> [width]. Offsets are 0-based; width defaults to 1 map unit. If the rooms share separate wall segments, the door uses the first one found scanning from the northwest.
# Exit format: exit <north|east|south|west> <room-ID> [wall-offset]. Without an offset, the exit is centered on that room's boundary; an explicit offset is measured from the west or north edge of the building.
# Wall picture format: picture <box|cat|dog|guitar|coffee-table|h|snake|apple|telephone|glasses|penny|fish> <bay-col> <bay-row> <side> <offset> <bottom-z> <width> <height>.
# Magic door format: magicdoor <side> <room-ID> <pair-ID>.
# Coffee table format: table <bay-col> <bay-row> <x> <y> <width> <depth> <height>.

